      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Known root values scale predictably.\n\nIf √841=29, then √8.41=2.9 because 8.41=841/100.\nSimilarly √0.0841=0.29.\n\nMoving the radicand by a factor of 100 moves the root by a factor of 10.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
